### Try the API with the "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request" above each line).
### Start the app first: F5 in VS Code, or docker compose up --build

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Add
GET {{host}}/api/add?a=0.1&b=0.2

### Subtract
GET {{host}}/api/subtract?a=10&b=4

### Multiply
GET {{host}}/api/multiply?a=6&b=7

### Divide
GET {{host}}/api/divide?a=10&b=4

### Divide by zero (returns 400)
GET {{host}}/api/divide?a=1&b=0

### Square root
GET {{host}}/api/sqrt?a=144

### Percentage: 25% of 80
GET {{host}}/api/percentage?mode=of&a=25&b=80

### Percentage: change from 80 to 100
GET {{host}}/api/percentage?mode=change&a=80&b=100

### Percentage: 20 is what % of 80
GET {{host}}/api/percentage?mode=what&a=20&b=80

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{host}}/metrics
